WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.201
Do not confuse the shared family pool with joint liability.

2
00:00:00.201 --> 00:00:00.459
The family safety net grows from brand-new profits above each person’s peak,

3
00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:00.714
and it never reaches into your pocket to cover someone else’s trading loss.
